          "label": "Test Procedure",
          "default": "The test procedure was in accordance with <Standard name>.\n\nThe EUT was placed on a wooden table/insulation support at 0.8/0.1m height. The power supply to the EUT was fed through a clean AC power source. The AC power source is in series with current transformer. The input voltage and frequency were set in the software as per the EUT specifications. The classification of the EUT and limits were selected as specified in the standard. The harmonic current emissions up to 40th harmonic was measured and compared with the limit specified in the standard."
